# Medium Tier (Smart) — Google Sheets Workbook Template

**Who this is for:** Smart 300 / Smart 600 / Smart 1000 clients  
**Total tabs:** 21  
**Builds on:** All 12 Low Tier tabs, plus 9 additions below  
**Protection:** Tabs marked 🔒 are backend-only. Tabs marked 👁 are client-viewable but not editable.

---

## HOW TO SET UP

1. Make a copy of the **Medium Tier Master Template** spreadsheet (not the Low Tier one).
2. Rename: `[Business Name] — Voice Agent (Smart)`
3. Share with Google Service Account email: **Editor** access.
4. Paste Sheet ID into Master Backend Sheet → Client Roster.
5. Fill in Business Info tab, Dynamic Intake Rules, and Staff Assignment Rules.
6. Apply protections (see bottom of this document).

---

