## TAB 18: Lost Lead Alerts 👁

Auto-populated when AI detects a promising lead who left without booking.

| Col | Field |
|-----|-------|
| A | alert_id |
| B | call_id |
| C | business_id |
| D | caller_name |
| E | caller_phone |
| F | service_requested |
| G | reason_lost_or_at_risk |
| H | lead_score |
| I | recommended_next_action |
| J | alert_sent (TRUE/FALSE) |
| K | alert_date |
| L | resolved_by_team (team fills: TRUE when actioned) |

**Trigger conditions:**
- Lead score ≥ 60 + no booking + no Calendly link sent
- Pricing question with no conversion
- Urgent + callback only (no booking)
- Incomplete call with lead score ≥ 40
- Calendly sent but no booking confirmed with score ≥ 55

