## TAB 19: Staff Assignment Rules

Defines which team member gets assigned based on service or location.

| Col | Field | Example |
|-----|-------|---------|
| A | service_name | HVAC Repair |
| B | location | North Austin |
| C | assigned_staff_name | Carlos Mendez |
| D | assigned_staff_email | carlos@business.com |
| E | assigned_staff_phone | +15125559999 |
| F | escalation_priority | High |
| G | notes | |

**Matching logic:**
- Exact match on both service + location → highest priority
- Service match only → second priority
- Location match only → third priority
- Blank service + blank location = catch-all rule (matched last)

