## PROTECTION INSTRUCTIONS — MEDIUM TIER

### Tabs client can edit freely:
- Business Info
- FAQ List
- Calendly Links
- Dynamic Intake Rules
- Service-Specific Questions
- Lead Scoring Rules (Advanced)

### Tabs client can VIEW but not edit (👁):
- Recordings
- Lost Lead Alerts (except column L — Resolved By Team)
- Weekly Reports
- Monthly Optimization Reports

### Tabs that are fully protected 🔒 (backend only):
- Call Log
- Needs Attention Today (view only)
- Appointments
- Do Not Call / Opt-Outs
- SMS Log
- Missed Call Recovery
- Monthly Usage
- Error Log
- AI Quality Scores
- Staff Assignment Rules (owner can edit, not client)

**To protect a tab:**
1. Right-click tab → Protect sheet
2. Add description (e.g., "Backend — Do Not Edit")
3. Set permissions: Only you + service account email
4. Show warning: Optional (for view-only client tabs)

